From d793365b79b971732f7737b7b3cbf748205c623a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tbrasselle <tbrasselle@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:51:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(finish3d): gap_link - a straight link across gap
 openings

Add the gap_link parameter to the finish3d parameters: Jump (default,
the retract/clearance hop, byte-for-byte unchanged) and Straight (one
straight Feed link between the run ends at their own tip height). The
Straight link is certified by the exact segment-triangle sweep of the
move at the budget r - TOUCH_EPS: grazing rims pass, a real bite
refuses, and a refusal takes the Jump hop. The raster serpentine runs
a broken back line whole (pieces reversed too), so gap links cross
their gap instead of the field. Project words jump/straight, no
version step-up; digest tag 0x4D only for a non-Jump choice.

Pinned by crates/motion/tests/finish3d_gaplink.rs (6 pins), the
project_roundtrip gap-link pins and the mcp params-door pin.

Fixes #1708
